      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "No time fer standin' around, Asakura!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_12_07_01_World_00009_KAsakura",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "Of course! I'll flank them from the right. Make sure to keep clear of Karrie's scythe, okay?",
