    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_12_07_01_World_00010_MAikawa",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "Ha! Who d'ya think yer talkin' to? If anythin', <i>she</i> oughta steer clear of <i>me</i>. This big-ass sword ain't just for show!",
